---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import downloadArtwork from '../assets/page-art/download-status.webp';
---

<BaseLayout title="RelayBridge v1.0.0-rc.1 — Public Windows release candidate" description="Download information for RelayBridge v1.0.0-rc.1, an unsigned Windows x64 pre-release for evaluation and community testing." image={downloadArtwork.src} imageAlt="RelayBridge release-status illustration showing a Windows service, local daemon, certificate keystore, and GitHub repository around an active-development package.">
  <section class="download-page section-dark">
    <div class="container download-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span></span> Downloads · Public RC</p>
        <h1>RelayBridge<br /><em>v1.0.0-rc.1</em></h1>
        <p class="download-lede">Public Windows release candidate for Windows x64.</p>
        <p class="release-warning">RelayBridge v1.0.0-rc.1 is an unsigned public pre-release intended for evaluation and community testing. Windows may display Unknown Publisher and Microsoft Defender SmartScreen may show a warning.</p>
        <p><strong>Verify the installer SHA-256 before running it.</strong></p>
        <code class="release-hash">4667AD60376B2D29F6E368980F7A533AF8424951B5FB0D7412396E527D6360DC</code>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="button button-accent" href="https://github.com/getrelaybridge/relaybridge/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.1">View v1.0.0-rc.1 on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="https://github.com/getrelaybridge/relaybridge/tree/v1.0.0-rc.1">View tagged source</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="release-card">
        <div class="release-card-head"><span>PUBLIC RC</span><b>WINDOWS X64</b></div>
        <div class="release-status-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
        <h2>Unsigned pre-release</h2>
        <p>For evaluation and community testing.</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Version</dt><dd>1.0.0-rc.1</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Windows x64</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Authenticode</dt><dd>NotSigned</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Signed stable release</dt><dd>Not yet available</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="container release-detail-grid">
      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Installation path</p>
        <h2>Use the bootstrapper on a clean machine.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">The recommended installer is:</p>
        <code class="release-installer">RelayBridge-Setup-1.0.0-rc.1-win-x64.exe</code>
        <p>The bootstrapper is the supported clean-machine path and handles the expected prerequisite and setup flow. A standalone MSI is also available on the GitHub Release for advanced and support purposes; it is not the normal clean-machine installation path.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Release verification</p>
        <h2>Evidence travels with the release.</h2>
        <p>The GitHub Release includes SHA256SUMS, a CycloneDX SBOM, release provenance, third-party notices, and source and license material.</p>
        <p>RC1 was built from the exact clean public source tag with <code>SourceTreeClean=true</code>, passed the release gates, was owner smoke-tested, uploaded without rebuilding, downloaded from GitHub, and re-hashed against the smoke-tested bytes.</p>
        <dl class="release-validation">
          <div><dt>Unit</dt><dd>86 / 86</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Integration</dt><dd>497 / 497</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Total</dt><dd>583 / 583</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Failed / skipped</dt><dd>0 / 0</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Build</dt><dd>0 warnings · 0 errors</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="release-evidence-note">These checks do not make RC1 a stable, certified, vulnerability-free, or production-proven release. A signed stable RelayBridge release is not yet available.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
